  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1.Place pork fat in a pan and cover with\nenough water. Boil until all
    the water has\nevaporated and the pork fat is rendered.\n\r\n2.Add garlic and
    saut\xE9 in the oil.\nContinue cooking until the pork fats are crisp.\n\r\n3.Season
    meat with salt and pepper then add\nto the pan. Cover with enough water. Put
    the\nchili in and cook until all the liquid has\nevaporated. Fry the meat for
    a few minutes.\n\r\n4.In a bowl, mix pig\u2019s blood with vinegar and a pinch
    of salt. Strain then pour over the meat. Simmer until meat is tender and sauce
    is slightly thick. Season to taste. Serve warm.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
